{
  "Lyre's Melody": "",
  "<size=20>Burning Moon's Cry</size>": "",
  "Lunar Phaseshift": "",
  "Go for Broke": "",
  "Leader's Guidance": "",
  "Clean Sweep": "",
  "Based on Kotone's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK), increase 1 ally's Crit DMG by up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. Stacks up to $4 times.\\nIf the target has <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>, grant $5 [Powerful Bond] stack ($6 turns, stacks up to $7 times). When <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $8 turns.\\nWhen Kotone is present, based on the target's [Powerful Bond] stacks, grant the following effects.\\n$9 [Powerful Bond] stack: Increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$10</color>.\\n$11 [Powerful Bond] stacks: Increase Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$12</color>.\\n$13 [Powerful Bond] stacks: Increase Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$14</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101><color=#F16A8E>Burn the fear that dwells within you to empower your allies, increasing the party's Crit DMG and applying a buff to yourself.</color></color></size></b>": "",
  "Burning Moon's Cry Lv.$1": "",
  "Burning Moon's Cry <color=#FBE70F>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). If the foe count is decreased below $3, increase damage by $4 per decreased foe.\\nIf the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> has $5 [Powerful Bond] stacks, based on Kotone's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> ATK), increase all foes' DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turn.\\nWhen <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, increase this skill's damage by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> and extend this skill's effect duration by $10 turns. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by <color=#FFFC40>$11</color> regardless of affinities.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101><color=#F16A8E>Pluck the strings of the lyre to unleash the flames of the soul, dealing Fire damage to all foes.</color></color></size></b>": "",
  "Cooldown Time: $1 turns (does not count Extra Actions).\\nBased on Kotone's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK), increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.\\nIf the main target does not have <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> (excluding Kotone), copy <link=\"s|310\"><u>Certain Buffs' Effects</u></link> granted by the target to the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> with a <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> <link=\"s|311\"><u>[Copy Multiplier]</u></link> of their original effectivness. These effects lasts for $5 turn, and certain effects cannot be copied.\\nWhen <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $6 turn.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101><color=#F16A8E>Envoking the radiance of passing days, share the buffs granted to the Arcana Link with another ally.</color></color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase all allies' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, and increase the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>'s ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. When <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $4 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nGo for Broke: Can only be used once per battle.\\nEnter <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state, and gain $5 Extra Actions.\\nWhen entering <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state, extend the duration of all [Powerful Bond] effects by $6 turns.\\nExtend the duration of all effects granted by Kotone's Persona skills/HIGHLIGHT while in this state.\\nWhen <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state ends, the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> immediately activates their HIGHLIGHT/Theurgy once without spending energy. Afterwards, Kotone enters [Sick] state for $7 turns.\\n[Sick]: Unable to act, and can only be removed through turn progression. This state is counted as a Mental Ailment.": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase all allies' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, and increase the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>'s ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. When <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $4 turns.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Fire damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nGo for Broke: Can only be used once per battle.\\nEnter <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state, and gain $5 Extra Actions.\\nWhen entering <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state, extend the duration of all Powerful Bond effects by $6 turns.\\nExtend the duration of all effects granted by Kotone's Persona skills/HIGHLIGHT while in this state.\\nWhen <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state ends, the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> immediately activates their HIGHLIGHT/Theurgy once without spending energy. Afterwards, Kotone enters [Sick] state for $7 turns.\\n[Sick]: Unable to act, and can only be removed through turn progression. This state is counted as a Mental Ailment.": "",
  "When granting buffs to allies, increase the main target's ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $2 turns. Stacks up to $3 times.": "",
  "When granting buffs to allies, increase the main target's ATK by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> for $2 turns. Stacks up to $3 times.": "",
  "When Powerful Bond is granted, increase the target's Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> for $2 turns.": "",
  "When Powerful Bond is granted, increase the target's Pierce by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> for $2 turns.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>Arcana Link</color>": "",
  "When an ally in this state uses a Persona skill, or when Kotone uses a Persona skill on them, increase the target's Lunar Bond, and grant effects based on the rank. Kotone can re-select the target on her turn, but doing so will remove any specific buff effects that have been granted.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>Fortune</color>": "",
  "When entering this state, gain $1 Extra Actions. When this state ends, the [Arcana Link] immediately activates their HIGHLIGHT/Theurgy. Afterwards, Kotone will enter [Sick] state for $2 turns, making her unable to act.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>Cetain Buff Effects</color>": "",
  "Includes buffs granted by {{A}} skills, Awareness, Talent, HIGHLIGHT, {{B}}, Buff Items, etc.": "",
  "<color=#66ccff>Copy Multiplier</color>": "",
  "When Kotone copies buff effects, their effectivness will be multiplied and granted to the target as a separate effect.": "",
  "Moment of Truth": "",
  "After obtaining {{A}}, during battle, for every Strategist present (including Wonder's currently equipped Persona), increase all allies' Total DMG Amp $1 (takes effect even when {{A}} is not in battle).\\nAt the start of battle, grant <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> to the Assassin/Sweeper ally with the highest ATK. At the start of {{A}}'s turn, she can reselect the target of <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>. Multiple allies cannot have <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> at the same time.\\nAfter the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> uses a {{C}} skill, or after {{A}} uses a {{C}} skill on the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>, increase the target's Lunar Bond by $2 (max $3). Grant the following effects based on Lunar Bond.\\nLunar Bond Rank $4: Increase ATK by $5.\\nLunar Bond Rank $6: Increase Pierce by $7.\\nLunar Bond Rank $8: Increase Crit DMG by $9\\n{{A}} can activate the special skill [Go for Broke] once per battle. When activated, she enters <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state.": "",
  "Echoing Strings": "",
  "When entering <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state, immediately activate Kotone's HIGHLIGHT once without spending HIGHLIGHT Energy.\\nAfter selecting the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>, permanently grant them $1 [Powerful Bond] stack while they have <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>, and set their Lunar Bond to $2.\\nAfter using [Lyre's Melody] on an ally with $3 [Powerful Bond] stacks, increase the target's Crit DMG by $4 for $5 turns.": "",
  "Team Mom": "",
  "When in <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> state, extend the duration of all effects granted by Kotone Shiomi's {{A}} skills/HIGHLIGHT by $1 more turn.\\nThe <link=\"s|311\"><u>[Copy Multiplier]</u></link> when using [Lunar Phaseshift] is multiplied by $2x.": "",
  "Full Moon Night": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of [Lyre's Melody] and [Thief Tactics].": "",
  "Eternal Bonds": "",
  "HIGHLIGHT Enhanced: Increase all allies' DMG Dealt by $1.": "",
  "Unquenchable Flames": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of [Burning Moon's Cry] and [Lunar Phaseshift].": "",
  "Song of the Soul": "",
  "[Go for Broke] can be used $1 more time.\\nWhen using [Lunar Phaseshift] on allies other than Wonder, if Wonder is not the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>, also copy buffs granted by Wonder to the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> with a <link=\"s|311\"><u>[Copy Multiplier]</u></link> of their original effectivness.": "",
  "Based on Kotone's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK), increase 1 ally's Crit DMG by up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. Stacks up to $4 times.\\nIf the target has <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>, grant $5 [Powerful Bond] stack ($6 turns, stacks up to $7 times). When <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $8 turns.\\nWhen Kotone is present, based on the target's [Powerful Bond] stacks, grant the following effects.\\n$9 [Powerful Bond] stack: Increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$10</color>.\\n$11 [Powerful Bond] stacks: Increase Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$12</color>.\\n$13 [Powerful Bond] stacks: Increase Total DMG Amp by <color=#FFFC40>$14</color>.": "",
  "Based on Kotone's ATK (up to $1 ATK), increase <color=#FFFF00>1</color> ally's Crit DMG by up to $2 for $3 turns. Stacks up to $4 times.\\nIf the target has [Arcana Link], grant $5 [Powerful Bond] stack ($6 turns, stacks up to $7 times). When [Fortune] is active, extend duration by $8 turns.\\nWhen Kotone is present, based on the target's [Powerful Bond] stacks, grant the following effects.\\n$9 [Powerful Bond] stack: Increase ATK by $10.\\n$11 [Powerful Bond] stacks: Increase Pierce by $12.\\n$13 [Powerful Bond] stacks: Increase Total DMG Amp by $14.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). If the foe count is decreased below $3, increase damage by $4 per decreased foe.\\nIf the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> has $5 [Powerful Bond] stacks, based on Kotone's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> ATK), increase all foes' DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turn.\\nWhen <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, increase this skill's damage by <color=#FFFC40>$9</color> and extend this skill's effect duration by $10 turns. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by <color=#FFFC40>$11</color> regardless of affinities.": "",
  "Deal Fire damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes equal to $2 of ATK ($1 hits). If the foe count is decreased below $3, increase damage by $4 per decreased foe.\\nIf the [Arcana Link] has $5 [Powerful Bond] stacks, based on Kotone's ATK (up to $6 ATK), increase all foes' DMG Taken by $7 for $8 turn.\\nWhen [Fortune] is active, increase this skill's damage by $9 and extend this skill's effect duration by $10 turns. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by $11 regardless of affinities.": "",
  "Cooldown Time: $1 turns (does not count Extra Actions).\\nBased on Kotone's ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> ATK), increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.\\nIf the main target does not have <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> (excluding {{A}}), copy <link=\"s|310\"><u>Certain Buffs' Effects</u></link> granted by the target to the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link> with a <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> <link=\"s|311\"><u>[Copy Multiplier]</u></link> of their original effectivness. These effects lasts for $5 turn, and certain effects cannot be copied.\\nWhen <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $6 turn.": "",
  "Cooldown Time: $1 turns (does not count Extra Actions).\\nBased on Kotone's ATK (up to $2 ATK), increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' ATK by $3.\\nIf the main target does not have [Arcana Link] (excluding {{A}}), copy Certain Buffs' Effects granted by the target to the [Arcana Link] with a $4 [Copy Multiplier] of their original effectivness. These effects lasts for $5 turn, and certain effects cannot be copied.\\nWhen [Fortune] is active, extend duration by $6 turn.": "",
  "Increase all allies' Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, and increase the <link=\"s|307\"><u>[Arcana Link]</u></link>'s ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. When <link=\"s|308\"><u>[Fortune]</u></link> is active, extend duration by $4 turns.": "",
  "Increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' Crit DMG by $1, and increase the [Arcana Link]'s ATK by $2 for $3 turns. When [Fortune] is active, extend duration by $4 turns.": "",
  "Can only be used once per battle.\\nEnter [Fortune] state, and gain $1 Extra Actions.\\nWhen entering [Fortune] state, extend the duration of all Powerful Bond effects by $2 turns.\\nExtend the duration of all effects granted by Kotone's Persona skills/HIGHLIGHT while in this state.\\nWhen [Fortune] state ends, the [Arcana Link] immediately activates their HIGHLIGHT/Theurgy once without spending energy. Afterwards, Kotone enters [Sick] state for $3 turns.\\n[Sick]: Unable to act, and can only be removed through turn progression. This state is counted as a Mental Ailment.": "",
