  "O<color=#000000>n</color> Paravani's Wings": "",
  "r:\"Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Freeze</u></link>\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. Gain (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ice Crystal</u></link> stacks\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. When Kotone has Parhelion or (\\d+)\\+ <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ice Crystal</u></link> stacks, increase damage based on foe's missing HP \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\nWhen Blade Dancer is activated, increase damage based on foe's missing HP \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. Increase damage based on foe's missing HP\\. When foe's HP is below (\\d+)%, increase by up to (\\d+)%\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Ice damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When damaging foes with Blade Dancer, <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Freeze</u></link>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When Kotone defeats a foe, gain <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> <link\\=(.+?)><u>Ice Crystal</u></link> stacks\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Spring mode: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\), with a (\\d+)% chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Windswept</u></link>\\. When Spring's Edge is active, also gain (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Spring's Vestige</u></link> stack and inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Spiral Sequence</u></link> for (\\d+) turns\\. When Frostgale Kotone attacks a foe with Spiral Sequence, increase critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\\nWinter mode: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Freeze</u></link>\\. If the target is already Frozen, inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>On Ice</u></link> for (\\d+) turns\\. Increase Ice damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for foes with On Ice\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Spring mode: Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\. When Spring's Edge is active, also gain (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Spring's Vestige</u></link> stacks\\.\\nWinter mode: Deal Ice damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack, with a <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Freeze</u></link>\\. When Winter's Edge is active, increase this skill's damage by (\\d+)%\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"^Spring mode: Activate Spring's Edge for (\\d+) turn, and deal Wind damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\. While Spring's Edge is active, when allies deal Wind damage with a skill, Highlight, Theurgy or <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Resonance</u></link>, deal Wind damage to the selected target equal to (\\d+)% of Frostgale Kotone's Attack, and gain (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Spring's Vestige</u></link> stack\\. When Spring's Edge ends, spend all Spring's Vestige stacks, and deal Wind damage to the target selected that turn equal to \\(number of Spring's Vestige stacks \\+ (\\d+)\\) x <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. This damage is counted as a Resonance\\.\\nWinter mode: Activate Winter's Edge for (\\d+) turn, and deal Ice damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. While Winter's Edge is active, when an ally takes an attack, grant Glacial Heart to all allies for (\\d+) turns, protecting them from up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> damage\\. This effect can be activated up to (\\d+) times\\. Also, when allies deal Ice damage with a skill, Highlight, Theurgy, or Resonance, gain (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Winter's Vestige</u></link> stack\\. When Winter's Edge ends, spend all Winter's Vestige stacks, and deal Ice damage to the target selected that turn equal to \\(number of Winter's Vestige stacks \\+ (\\d+)\\) x <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. This damage is counted as a Resonance\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>In Spring mode, deal Wind damage to an enemy\\. In Winter mode, deal Ice damage to an enemy\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"(?s)Highlight.*?Spring mode: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\).*?Spring's Edge is active, gain (\\d+) more <link\\=(.+?)><u>Spring's Vestige</u></link> stack.*?not active, deal (\\d+) more hit.*?Winter mode: Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack.*?<color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Icebound</u></link>.*?increase chance to inflict Icebound by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>.*?increase Highlight damage by (\\d+)%.*?1 MORE.*?Spring mode: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe.*?Winter mode.*?Deal Ice damage to 1 foe.*?Melee Attack.*?Physical damage.*?Ranged Attack.*?Gun damage.*?out of ammo.*?\"": "",
  "r:\"At the start of battle, if a Wind ally is in the party, increase Frostgale Kotone's Wind damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\\nAt the start of battle, if an Ice ally is in the party, increase Frostgale Kotone's Ice damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"While in Spring mode, each time an ally attacks with the Wind attribute, increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\nWhile in Winter mode, each time Frostgale Kotone gains a shield, increase party's Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"^Based on Kotone Shiomi's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\), increase (\\d+) ally's critical damage by up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\nIf the main target is in the <link\\=\"s\\|307\"><u>Arcana Link</u></link> state, grant (\\d+) {{A}}ful Bond stack \\((\\d+) turns, stacks up to (\\d+) times\\)\\. When Kotone Shiomi is present, based on the total number of stacks, grant the following effects to the target\\.\\n1: Increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.\\n2: Increase pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.\\n3: Increase <link\\=\"s\\|236\"><u>Final Damage Amplification</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.\\nWhen in the <link\\=\"s\\|308\"><u>Fortune</u></link> state, extend this skill's effect duration by (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101><color\\=#F16A8E>Burn the fear that dwells within you to empower your allies, increasing the party's critical damage and applying a buff on yourself\\.</color></color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Fire damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\. If the enemy count is reduced below (\\d+), increase damage by (\\d+)% per reduced foe\\.\\nIf the ally in the <link\\=\"s\\|307\"><u>Arcana Link</u></link> state has (\\d+) {{A}}ful Bonds, based on Kotone Shiomi's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\), increase all foes' damage taken by up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turn\\.\\nWhen in the <link\\=\"s\\|308\"><u>Fortune</u></link> state, increase this skill's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> more and extend duration by (\\d+) turns\\. Also, decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> regardless of affinities\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101><color\\=#F16A8E>Pluck the strings of the lyre to unleash the flames of the soul, dealing Fire damage to all enemies\\.</color></color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Based on Kotone Shiomi's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\), increase party's Attack by up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turn\\.\\nIf the main target is an ally without the Arcana Link state \\(excluding Kotone Shiomi\\), copy <link\\=\"s\\|310\"><u>certain buffs' effects</u></link> granted by the target to the Arcana Link ally with a <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> <link\\=\"s\\|311\"><u>copy multiplier</u></link> of their original effectiveness\\. These effects last for (\\d+) turn, and certain effects cannot be copied\\.\\nWhen in the Fortune state, extend this skill's effect duration by (\\d+) turn\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) turns \\(does not count extra actions\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101><color\\=#F16A8E>Evoking the radiance of passing days, share the buffs granted to your Arcana Link companion with another ally\\.</color></color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Increase party's critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>, and also increase Attack of the ally in the <link\\=\"s\\|307\"><u>Arcana Link</u></link> state by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. When in the <link\\=\"s\\|308\"><u>Fortune</u></link> state, extend duration by (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Fire damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nGo for Broke：Can only be used once per battle\\.\\nEnter the Fortune state, and gain (\\d+) extra actions\\. Also, extend the duration of all {{A}}ful Bond effects by (\\d+) turns\\.\\nExtend the duration of all effects granted by Kotone Shiomi's skills and Highlight while in this state\\.\\nAfter using her (\\d+) extra actions, the Fortune state ends, and the ally in the <link\\=\"s\\|307\"><u>Arcana Link</u></link> state activates their Highlight or Theurgy once without spending the gauge\\. Afterwards, Kotone Shiomi enters the Sick state for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nSick: Unable to act, and can only be removed through turn progression\\. This state is counted as a spiritual ailment\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When granting buffs to allies, increase the main target's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When {{A}}ful Bond is granted, increase the target's pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.$\"": "",
  "After obtaining Kotone Shiomi, during battle, for every Strategist present (including Wonder's currently equipped Persona), increase party's <link\\=\"s|236\"><u>final damage amplification</u></link> by 1% (takes effect even when Kotone Shiomi is not in battle). At the start of battle, grant the Arcana Link state to the Sweeper or Assassin ally with the highest Attack. At the start of Kotone Shiomi's turn, she can reselect the target of Arcana Link. Multiple allies cannot be in the Arcana Link state at the same time.\\nWhen the ally in the Arcana Link state uses a skill, or when Kotone Shiomi uses a skill on the ally in the Arcana Link state, increase the target's Lunar Bond (max 10). Also, gain the following effects based on current Lunar Bond.\\n1: Increase Attack by 50%.\\n5: Increase pierce rate by 15%.\\n10: Increase critical damage by 50%.\\nWhen reselecting the target of Arcana Link, Lunar Bond is reset.\\nAlso, Kotone Shiomi can activate Go for Broke once per battle. When activated, she enters the <link\\=\"s|308\"><u>Fortune</u></link> state.": "",
  "When entering the <link\\=\"s|308\"><u>Fortune</u></link> state, immediately activate Highlight once without spending the Highlight gauge.\\nWhen granting an ally the <link\\=\"s|307\"><u>Arcana Link</u></link> state, grant them 1 permanent Powerful Bond stack while they are in the Arcana Link state, and set Lunar Bond to 5.\\nIf an ally has 3 Powerful Bond stacks after receiving Lyre's Melody, increase the target's critical damage by 30% more for 5 turns.": "",
  "When in the <link\\=\"s|308\"><u>Fortune</u></link> state, extend the duration of all effects granted by Kotone Shiomi's skills and Highlight by 1 more turn. Also, the <link\\=\"s|311\"><u>copy multiplier</u></link> when using Lunar Phaseshift is multiplied by 1.25.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Lyre's Melody and Combat Tactics.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase party's damage by 25% for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Burning Moon's Cry and Lunar Phaseshift.": "",
  "Go for Broke can be used 1 more time.\\nWhen using Lunar Phaseshift on allies other than Wonder, if Wonder is not in the <link\\=\"s|307\"><u>Arcana Link</u></link> state, also copy <link\\=\"s|310\"><u>certain buffs' effects</u></link> granted by Wonder to the Arcana Link ally with a <link\\=\"s|311\"><u>copy multiplier</u></link> of their original effectiveness. These effects last for 1 turn, and certain effects cannot be copied.": "",
  "r:\"^Based on Kotone Shiomi's Atk \\(up to (\\d+)\\), increase (\\d+) ally's crit dmg up to ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns, max (\\d+) stacks\\)\\.\\nIf main target has Arcana Link, grant (\\d+) {{A}}ful Bond \\((\\d+) turns, max (\\d+) stacks\\)\\. When Kotone Shiomi is present, grant following effects to target based on number of stacks\\.\\n1: Increase Atk ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.\\n2: Increase pierce rate ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.\\n3: Increase final dmg amplification ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.\\nWith Fortune, extend effect duration by (\\d+) turns\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Fire dmg to all foes equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of Atk \\((\\d+) hits\\)\\. If enemy count is reduced below (\\d+), increase dmg (\\d+)% per reduced foe\\.\\nIf Arcana Link ally has (\\d+) {{A}}ful Bond, based on Kotone Shiomi's Atk \\(max\\. (\\d+)\\), increase all foes' dmg taken up to ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.\\nWith Fortune, increase this skill's dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% more, extend duration by (\\d+) turns, and decrease Down Points of all targets that take dmg by (\\d+) regardless of affinities\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Based on Kotone Shiomi's Atk \\(max (\\d+)\\), increase party's Atk up to ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turn\\)\\.\\nIf main target does not have Arcana Link \\(excluding Kotone Shiomi\\), copy certain buffs' effects granted by target to Arcana Link ally with ([\\d\\.]+)% copy multiplier of original effectiveness \\((\\d+) turn\\)\\. Certain effects cannot be copied\\.\\nWith Fortune, extend effect duration by (\\d+) turn\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) turns \\(does not count extra actions\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Can be used once per battle\\.\\nEnter Fortune state, and gain (\\d+) extra actions\\. Also, extend duration of all {{A}}ful Bond effects by (\\d+) turns\\.\\nExtend duration of all effects granted by Kotone Shiomi's skills and Highlight while in this state\\.\\nWhen Fortune state ends, ally with Arcana Link can activate their Highlight or Theurgy once without spending the gauge\\. Afterwards, Kotone Shiomi enters Sick state \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nSick: Unable to act\\. Counted as a spiritual ailment\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's crit dmg ([\\d\\.]+)%, and also increase Atk of ally with Arcana Link ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\. With Fortune, extend duration by (\\d+) turns\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant Arcana Link to (\\d+) ally\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Gain (\\d+) extra actions and enhance Kotone's skills and Highlight\\.$\"": "",
  "Increase and grant ally in the Arcana Link state buffs.": "",
  "When using a skill, or when receiving a skill from Kotone Shiomi, increase Lunar Bond.": ""
}